# 1640s (2026-10-18): longbowmen - a storm of arrows from long range, give ground before a charge.
drill "Archers"
era 1640s
about "Longbowmen: a storm of arrows from ninety metres, and give ground before anything that charges."
type Archer
dials aggression 0.20 discipline 0.60 cohesion 0.60 cover 0.50 patience 0.10 nerve 0.50

sergeant:
  when enemy charging and enemy within 30                -> fall back 25; fire at will
  when enemy within 92                                  -> hold; fire at will
  otherwise                                              -> advance; hold fire

man:
  when enemy within 92 and loaded                       -> fire
  otherwise                                              -> follow sergeant
